## 7. Environment Variable Naming

All project-specific environment variables **MUST** use the prefix `{{ python_module_name | upper }}_`.

```
# ✅ Correct
{{ python_module_name | upper }}_DATA_ROOT=/mnt/data/...
{{ python_module_name | upper }}_DEBUG=true

# ❌ Wrong — missing prefix
DATA_ROOT=/mnt/data/...
DEBUG=true
```

**Exceptions:** Third-party standards keep their names (e.g., `POSTGRES_USER`, `DOCKER_HOST`).
